#: ../../upstream/docs/user/explanation/documentation-structure.rst:2
msgid "How to structure your documentation"
msgstr "如何组织文档结构"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/explanation/documentation-structure.rst:4
msgid ""
"A documentation project's ultimate goal is to be read and understood by a "
"reader. Readers need to be able to :term:`discover <discoverability>` the "
"information that they need. Without an defined structure, readers either "
"won't find information that they need or get frustrated on the way."
msgstr ""
"文档项目的最终目标是让读者阅读并理解。读者需要能够 :term:`发现 <discoverability>` "
"所需信息。若没有明确定义的结构，读者要么找不到所需信息，要么在过程中感到挫败。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/explanation/documentation-structure.rst:9
msgid ""
"One of the largest benefits of a good structure is that it removes questions"
" that keep authors from writing documentation. Starting with a blank page is"
" often the hardest part of documentation, so anything we can do to remove "
"this problem is a win."
msgstr "良好结构的最大益处之一是消除阻碍作者动笔的疑虑。从空白页开始往往是写文档最难的部分，因此我们能为此做的任何努力都是值得的。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/explanation/documentation-structure.rst:14
msgid "Choosing a structure"
msgstr "选择结构"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/explanation/documentation-structure.rst:16
msgid ""
"Good news! You don't have to invent all of the structure yourself, since a "
"lot of experience-based work has been done to come up with a universal "
"documentation structure."
msgstr "好消息！你不必自己发明全部结构，因为已有大量基于经验的成果总结出了一套通用的文档结构。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/explanation/documentation-structure.rst:20
msgid "In order to avoid starting with a blank page, we recommend a simple process:"
msgstr "为避免从空白页开始，我们推荐一个简单的流程："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/explanation/documentation-structure.rst:23
msgid ""
"Choose a structure for your documentation. We recommend `Diátaxis "
"<https://diataxis.fr/>`_ for this."
msgstr "为你的文档选择结构。我们推荐使用 `Diátaxis <https://diataxis.fr/>`_ 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/explanation/documentation-structure.rst:24
msgid "Find a :doc:`example project </examples>` or template to start from."
msgstr "找一个 :doc:`示例项目 </examples>` 或模板作为起点。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/explanation/documentation-structure.rst:25
msgid "Start writing by filling in the structure."
msgstr "按结构填充内容开始写作。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/explanation/documentation-structure.rst:27
msgid ""
"This process helps you get started quickly, and helps keep things consistent"
" for the reader of your documentation."
msgstr "该流程帮助你快速起步，并让你的文档读者获得一致体验。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/explanation/documentation-structure.rst:33
msgid "Diátaxis Methodology"
msgstr "Diátaxis 方法论"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/explanation/documentation-structure.rst:35
msgid ""
"The documentation you're reading is written using the Diátaxis framework. It"
" has four major parts as summarized by this image:"
msgstr "你正在阅读的文档采用 Diátaxis 框架编写，包含如下图中概括的四个主要部分："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/explanation/documentation-structure.rst:40
msgid ""
"We recommend that you read more about it in the `official Diátaxis "
"documentation <https://diataxis.fr/>`_."
msgstr "我们建议在 `official Diátaxis documentation <https://diataxis.fr/>`_ 中了解更多。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/explanation/documentation-structure.rst:43
msgid "Explaining the structure to your users"
msgstr "向用户讲解结构"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/explanation/documentation-structure.rst:45
msgid ""
"One of the benefits of Diátaxis is that it's a well-known structure, and "
"users might already be familiar with it. As long as you stick to the "
"structure, your users should be able to use existing experience to navigate."
msgstr "Diátaxis 的优势之一是它是广为人知的结构，用户可能已经熟悉。只要坚持使用该结构，用户就能借助既有经验进行导航。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/explanation/documentation-structure.rst:50
msgid ""
"Using the names that are defined (eg. Tutorials, Explanation) in a user-"
"facing way also helps here."
msgstr "以面向用户的方式使用已定义的名称（如 Tutorials、Explanation）同样有帮助。"

